From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: psdoom-plus contributors <psdoom-plus@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:46:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] psDooM: processes as bots through libpsd

Hooks for engines/q3/psdoom/g_psd.c: init/shutdown/frame, who may hurt a
process bot, wound and frag (renice and kill), holding a fragged process
bot down until libpsd answers, and dropping process bots left over from
the last map. G_AddBot returns the new bot's client number.
---
 code/game/g_active.c |  3 +++
 code/game/g_bot.c    | 13 +++++++------
 code/game/g_client.c |  4 ++++
 code/game/g_combat.c |  5 +++++
 code/game/g_local.h  |  4 ++++
 code/game/g_main.c   |  3 +++
 6 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/code/game/g_active.c b/code/game/g_active.c
index d7c2311..378e9d2 100644
--- a/code/game/g_active.c
+++ b/code/game/g_active.c
@@ -1122,6 +1122,9 @@ void ClientThink_real( gentity_t *ent ) {
 		// In Last man standing, we force a quick respawn, since
 		// the player must be able to loose health
 		// pressing attack or use is the normal respawn method
+		if ( PSQ3_HoldRespawn( ent ) ) {
+			return;
+		}
 		if ( ( level.time > client->respawnTime ) &&
 			( ( ( g_forcerespawn.integer > 0 ) && 
 			( level.time - client->respawnTime  > g_forcerespawn.integer * 1000 ) ) ||
